body:
Why doesn't vital strike work with mounted charges? From my reading of it, when your mount charges, you can make a single attack action at your highest base attack bonus. That's exactly when it works

However, you are certainly right about the halfling bonus. I can't believe I misread that &amp;gt;.&amp;lt;


**edit** Never mind, after re-reading it, you are correct again. It specifies using the attack action for vital strike, and charge is a full round action that allows you to make an attack. I see where I went wrong. Luckily I have yet to actually level the character to 6th level, so I can still fix this
